  "details": "Repeatedly joining a world with lots of avatar pedestals can lead to an issue where the player's avatar won't load for a long while, sometimes followed by a client crash.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Join a world with >70 avatar pedestals, e.g. 100 Avatars https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_39d5d7b5-2c3f-4916-97ae-11013554b879\n2. Rejoin, or join a new instance of, this world.\n3. Repeat\nNote:\nI discovered this while working on Furhub, which has 74 pedestals, and several users were able to reproduce a client crash within 3 consecutive world joins. To fix it, I removed all but 1 single VRC Avatar Pedestal object, and I just change its blueprint ID via script.",
